        "title": "Kahimdai diu halleluijah",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kahimdai diu halleluijah,",
            "Aniu thuan e Immanuel;",
            "Thuanmei khatni guang kaguaina,",
            "Tingsangjang nang tuang su kandiu.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Halleluijah (2), Amen,",
            "Halleluijah (2), Amen.",
            "",
            "2. Kandih mei guai nangta thuan diu,",
            "Banchra guai le lung khat suna;",
            "Nang jei #-5 thuak lou khou tei #-5,",
            "Salem kathan khou ruan bamni.",
            "",
            "3. Nthuk liangmmei kauliangmei pu,",
            "Taruai rampang thang lu gaimei;",
            "Nang njianmei le njangmei,",
            "Tingkauh pari sangam mak ge.",
            "",
            "4. Thukmei himdaimei ndao lou,",
            "Kross rukhou akhang khanghloumei;",
            "Tingkauh pirun pat lou duna,",
            "Eden Salem kathan khou tei."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
